========================================
PDF VALIDATION USING APACHE PDFBOX
========================================

1. LOAD THE PDF
----------------

PDDocument document = Loader.loadPDF(pdfFile);

PDDocument
    → Class from Apache PDFBox

document
    → Reference variable

Loader
    → Class

loadPDF()
    → Static method

pdfFile
    → File object representing the PDF

Meaning:
→ Opens/loads the PDF file using PDFBox.
→ Returns a PDDocument object representing the opened PDF.


2. GET NUMBER OF PAGES
-----------------------

int pages = document.getNumberOfPages();

getNumberOfPages()
    → Returns the total number of pages in the PDF.

Example:
If PDF contains 2 pages:

pages = 2


3. VALIDATE THAT PDF CONTAINS PAGES
------------------------------------

Assert.assertTrue(
        pages > 0,
        "Pdf file not contains Pages "
);

Meaning:
→ The PDF must contain at least one page.

pages > 0
    → Expected condition

If pages = 0
    → Test fails

If pages = 1, 2, 3...
    → Test passes


4. CREATE PDF TEXT STRIPPER
----------------------------

PDFTextStripper pdfTextStripper = new PDFTextStripper();

PDFTextStripper
    → Class from Apache PDFBox

pdfTextStripper
    → Reference variable

new PDFTextStripper()
    → Creates a PDFTextStripper object

Purpose:
→ Used to extract/read text from the PDF.


5. EXTRACT TEXT FROM PDF
-------------------------

String pdfText = pdfTextStripper.getText(document);

getText(document)
    → Extracts all readable text from the PDF.

document
    → The PDF that was loaded earlier.

pdfText
    → String containing the extracted PDF text.


6. VALIDATE PDF CONTENT
-----------------------

Assert.assertTrue(
        pdfText.contains("Purchase Report"),
        "Purchase Report title not found"
);

contains("Purchase Report")
    → Checks whether the extracted PDF text contains
      "Purchase Report".

If found:
    → Test passes

If not found:
    → Test fails with:
      "Purchase Report title not found"


========================================
COMPLETE FLOW
========================================

PDF File
   ↓
Loader.loadPDF(pdfFile)
   ↓
PDDocument
   ↓
getNumberOfPages()
   ↓
Validate pages > 0
   ↓
PDFTextStripper
   ↓
getText(document)
   ↓
String pdfText
   ↓
contains("Purchase Report")
   ↓
PDF content validated


IMPORTANT CLASSES
-----------------

Loader
→ Class used to load/open the PDF.

PDDocument
→ Class representing the loaded PDF document.

PDFTextStripper
→ Class used to extract text from the PDF.


IMPORTANT METHODS
-----------------

Loader.loadPDF(pdfFile)
→ Loads the PDF.

document.getNumberOfPages()
→ Gets number of pages.

pdfTextStripper.getText(document)
→ Extracts text from PDF.

pdfText.contains("Purchase Report")
→ Checks whether specific text exists.